         reference alongside the adapter itself once the v2 execution layer lands - PR114a). -->
    <ProjectReference Include="..\src\Tesserafin.Playback.Dlna\Tesserafin.Playback.Dlna.csproj" />
    <!-- PR113: PlaybackDiagnosticDetail's Comparison exposes DivergenceClass (and derives from the
         retained DecisionVector), the shadow-mode comparison vocabulary - never the internal
         ShadowDiagnosticRecord's raw PlaybackDecision/DecisionVector/ShadowDivergence types beyond
         what the mapper projects out of them. -->
